SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The notice above is the ORIGINAL AUTHOR'S. It is Mlie's MIT licence, taken from
the repository of Creatures of Ki (Continued), which continues Shooki's mod:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2726461020
  https://github.com/emipa606/CreaturesOfKi

It travels with this extraction because MIT requires it to, and because it is
what grants the right to publish this mod at all. Shooki designed the teshi;
Mlie carried the mod to 1.4.

The teshi, its body, its items and its nine textures are theirs, taken as they
were. The extraction and 1.6 port work - deciding what to take, migrating
wildness from a race field to a stat, the unfertilised egg def, the French, the
packaging and the documentation - is nelim's, and is offered under the same MIT
terms as the notice above.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken, what was left behind and what was
changed, file by file.
